Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:00:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1157/1198] HERESY 1167: the second towel: the veil 7 s, the
 Writer row whole, one artwork a take, the disliked hidden as SUNO hides them,
 the Style heading's WARNING and ?
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026, afternoon:
· «Пять секунд мало. на LOADING. Давай 7. Это стоит того»: the veil holds seven seconds at least (seventeen at most), its
  line fills in seven.
· «баг Творца>Писателя… `% ...` выскочило»: with a document in hand the Writer row cut its title («Я - бур…») and broke
  «Сохранить в Писателе» over lines (at 1536 px the title 45 px, the button four lines). It wraps now between two groups:
  the document whole beside its ✕, the menu and the button beside it while they fit, under it to the right when not; the
  button's words never break.
· «Когда пошла генерация обложки, запрещай на том же треке повторный запуск процесса»: one drawing a take at a time from
  the page: a second ask while it draws or waits is told so and not sent (the lab kept one job a take, but the page started
  a second poller and a second pair of toasts); the take's menu says «Drawing artwork…» / «Artwork waits for a card…»
  then. The lab now holds a job that finds no card in its queue (the lab's own commit): the wait is said once.
· «Как в SUNO… дизлайк прятал трек, не удаляя, а в строке сортировки и т.п. добавить чекбокс показа/скрытия треков с
  дизлайками» («Дизлайк должен сбрасывать звезду», as it does): a disliked take leaves the Librarian and the rooms' takes
  column, nothing deleted; one setting (yue2.showDisliked): «Show disliked» beside the Librarian's sort, «The disliked ones
  too» in the column's ⋯ (it was the opposite, «Without the disliked», off); the 👎 chip shows them whatever it says; a
  dislike says where the take went; a rating from anywhere (the player bar too) repaints both lists. Checked on the live
  page with the lab's «rate» answered in the page: the library untouched (its checksum the same before and after).
· the Style block: «Знак вопроса отрендерить жирным SVG с полной выключкой вправо… предупреждения… в ту же строку перед
  знаком вопроса с автоматически появляющимся WARNING и при наведении тултип крупно 16pt с разъяснением ожидаемой проблемы.
  Полосу со счётчиками… не красным, а 80% gray… в одну строку»: the cheat-sheet's button a bold ? (SVG) at the end of the
  heading's line; before it, by itself, a WARNING when the style is unlike the model's training ones or style and lyrics
  pass the budget, its tip at 16 pt: what is wrong point by point, and what to expect; when the score's and the song's
  budgets alone fill the window (the budget went below zero: «of -4 148»), it says so and which knobs free it. The counter
  one line: «Characters: N · tokens: ≈N · with the lyrics: ≈N of N», 80 % of the ink, never red or amber. A big tip that
  fits neither above nor below its target stands beside it.
The console test: the counter's new words, the WARNING and its tip; the kitchen's take/takes line measured after the tall
bar settles (it passed by timing before). 14 + 1 + 17 keys in the six catalogs.
cdp-console 334/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

